{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "以后就好好共事吧  (Let's Work Well Together From Now On)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After a week of silence, Xin Huimei's manager tells Chun Yuqiao she plans to withdraw from Twelve Singers so the scandal won't hurt the show. Moments later, Bu Xiaogu brings Yuqiao his stomach medicine—and HR's warning echoes in her ears. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美今天说为了不影响十二歌王和黄金一班的合作，她自己决定退出节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，吃药了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我怎么不记得了？那天我去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在你看来，我们从来都不是一类人？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我怎么会胡思乱想呢，我不会的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是领导，是师兄，是我的偶像。我们两个的差距太大了，我应该跟您好好学习。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道了，那现在一切都清楚了。你是一个合格的员工，以后就好好共事吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "别总说没事，您要是心里有什么不舒服或者不开心的，您就跟我说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "本来我们就不是一类人，过去不是，现在更不是。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除了工作，我什么都无所谓。所以现在，契约解除。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说什么？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美今天说为了不影响十二歌王和黄金一班的合作，她自己决定退出节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei said today that so she doesn't hurt Twelve Singers and the Golden Class, she has decided to withdraw.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me time to think of another way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，吃药了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, it's time to take your stomach medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我怎么不记得了？那天我去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who says I forgot our pier appointment? That night, I went.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在你看来，我们从来都不是一类人？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So in your eyes, the two of us have never been the same kind of people?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我怎么会胡思乱想呢，我不会的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could I ever harbor wild ideas — I never would.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是领导，是师兄，是我的偶像。我们两个的差距太大了，我应该跟您好好学习。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are my executive, my senior alumnus, and my idol; the gap between us is huge, and I should learn from you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道了，那现在一切都清楚了。你是一个合格的员工，以后就好好共事吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I understand — everything is crystal clear now. You are a qualified employee; let's simply work together professionally.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "别总说没事，您要是心里有什么不舒服或者不开心的，您就跟我说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please don't always say nothing's wrong; if anything is bothering you inside, tell me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "本来我们就不是一类人，过去不是，现在更不是。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We were never the same kind of people in the first place — not in the past, and even less so now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除了工作，我什么都无所谓。所以现在，契约解除。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Outside of work, nothing matters to me at all. So as of right now, our pact is dissolved.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you just say?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美今天说为了不影响十二歌王和黄金一班的合作，她自己决定退出节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，吃药了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我怎么不记得了？那天我去了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在你看来，我们从来都不是一类人？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我怎么会胡思乱想呢，我不会的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是领导，是师兄，是我的偶像。我们两个的差距太大了，我应该跟您好好学习。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道了，那现在一切都清楚了。你是一个合格的员工，以后就好好共事吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "别总说没事，您要是心里有什么不舒服或者不开心的，您就跟我说。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "本来我们就不是一类人，过去不是，现在更不是。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除了工作，我什么都无所谓。所以现在，契约解除。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说什么？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stung when Xiaogu draws a polite line between boss and subordinate, Chun Yuqiao coldly declares they were never the same kind of people and dissolves their unspoken pact. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
